{"speciesId":76,"names":{"fr":"Grolem","es":"Golem","en":"Golem","ja":"ゴローニャ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"red","text":"Its boulder-like body is extremely hard. It can easily withstand dynamite blasts without damage."},{"language":"en","version":"blue","text":"Its boulder-like body is extremely hard. It can easily withstand dynamite blasts without damage."},{"language":"en","version":"yellow","text":"Once it sheds its skin, its body turns tender and whitish. Its hide hardens when it's exposed to air."},{"language":"en","version":"gold","text":"It sheds its skin once a year. The discarded shell immediately hard­ ens and crumbles away."},{"language":"en","version":"silver","text":"It is capable of blowing itself up. It uses this explosive force to jump from mountain to mountain."},{"language":"en","version":"crystal","text":"Its rock-like body is so durable, even high-powered dynamite blasts fail to scratch its rugged hide."},{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"GOLEM live up on mountains. If there is a large earthquake, these POKéMON will come rolling down off the mountains en masse to the foothills below."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"GOLEM is known for rolling down from mountains. To prevent them from rolling into the homes of people downhill, grooves have been dug into the sides of mountains to serve as guideways for diverting this POKéMON’s course."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"It is said to live in volcanic craters on mountain peaks. Once a year, it sheds its hide and grows larger. The shed hide crumbles and returns to the soil."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"It is enclosed in a hard shell that is as rugged as slabs of rock. It sheds skin once a year to grow larger."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"Its boulder-like body is extremely hard. It can easily withstand dynamite blasts without taking damage."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"It sheds its hide once a year. Its boulderlike body is so tough, even dynamite can’t harm it."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"It tumbles down mountains, leaving grooves from peak to base. Stay clear of these grooves."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"Even dynamite can’t harm its hard, boulderlike body. It sheds its hide just once a year."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"It sheds its skin once a year. The discarded shell immediately hardens and crumbles away."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"It is capable of blowing itself up. It uses this explosive force to jump from mountain to mountain."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Aucun explosif ne pourrait entamer sa carapace de pierre. Il mue une fois par an."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"Even dynamite can’t harm its hard, boulderlike body. It sheds its hide just once a year."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Aucun explosif ne pourrait entamer sa carapace de pierre. Il mue une fois par an."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"Even dynamite can’t harm its hard, boulderlike body. It sheds its hide just once a year."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"Even dynamite can’t harm its hard, boulder-like body. It sheds its hide just once a year."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"Even dynamite can’t harm its hard, boulder-like body. It sheds its hide just once a year."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"À force de dévaler les falaises, il a creusé de larges sillons. Mieux vaut ne pas s’en approcher."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Se lanza montaña abajo y deja un surco desde la cima hasta el pie. Es mejor mantenerse alejado."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"It tumbles down mountains, leaving grooves from peak to base. Stay clear of these grooves."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"山頂から ふもとまで 続く 溝は ゴローニャが 転がり落ちる 通り道なので 要注意。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Aucun explosif ne pourrait entamer sa carapace de pierre. Il mue une fois par an."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Ni siquiera la dinamita puede dañar su cuerpo rocoso. Muda la piel una vez al año."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"Even dynamite can’t harm its hard, boulder-like body. It sheds its hide just once a year."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"岩石の ような 硬い 体は ダイナマイトでも 傷つかない。 １年に １度だけ 脱皮する。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Grolem vit à la montagne. Lorsqu’il y a un tremblement de terre, ces Pokémon roulent en groupe vers les contreforts montagneux."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Golem vive en las montañas. Si se produce un gran terremoto, estos Pokémon descienden rodando en masa por las laderas."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Golem live up on mountains. If there is a large earthquake, these Pokémon will come rolling down off the mountains en masse to the foothills below."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"大きな 地震が 起こると 山に すんでいる ゴローニャが 何匹も ふもとまで ごろごろ 転がり 落ちてくる ことが あるよ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"On sait que les Grolem se laissent rouler en bas des montagnes. Afin d’éviter qu’ils roulent sur les maisons des gens, des tranchées ont été creusées le long des montagnes pour les guider dans leurs descentes infernales."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Golem es conocido por su afición a bajar de las montañas rodando. La gente que vive en la falda de las mismas ha cavado surcos para conducirlo en su descenso por las laderas y evitar que se cuele en sus casas."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Golem is known for rolling down from mountains. To prevent them from rolling into the homes of people downhill, grooves have been dug into the sides of mountains to serve as guideways for diverting this Pokémon’s course."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"山の 斜面に 掘ってある 溝は 転がり 落ちてきた ゴローニャが 民家に ぶつからない ように するための 通り道に なっているぞ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"Son corps est si solide qu’il peut résister à l’explosion d’un bâton de dynamite, mais il craint l’humidité et la pluie."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"Su robusto cuerpo puede soportar una explosión de dinamita sin inmutarse, pero no tolera bien ni la humedad ni la lluvia."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"Its body can survive dynamite blasts without a single scratch, but it hates rain and humidity."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"ダイナマイトで 爆破 しても 傷ひとつ つかない 身体 だが 湿気や 雨は 大嫌い。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"Ce Pokémon mue une fois par an. Sa carapace se transforme en humus très prisé par les agriculteurs."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"Muda su caparazón una vez al año. En muchas granjas lo aprovechan, pues este se puede utilizar para fertilizar el suelo."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"Once a year, this Pokémon molts, and its shed shell returns to the soil. This process creates enriched soil, so farmers collect the shells."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"１年に １度 脱皮。 脱いだ殻は 土に かえり 土壌を 豊かに するので 農家が 集めている。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Lorsqu’il arrive à un âge avancé, il arrête de muer. Un Grolem ayant vécu très longtemps est recouvert de mousse verte."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"A medida que envejece, pierde la facultad de mudar la piel. Se han observado ejemplares de edad avanzada totalmente cubiertos de musgo."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"When Golem grow old, they stop shedding their shells. Those that have lived a long, long time have shells green with moss."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"年老いると 脱皮 しなくなる。 長く長く 生きた ゴローニャの カラは 苔むしていて 緑だ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Il est capable de faire exploser une partie de son corps. Le souffle lui permet de se projeter à toute vitesse vers les sommets."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Puede hacer estallar su cuerpo a voluntad. El impulso que esto genera le permite ascender a toda velocidad a la cima de las montañas."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"It detonates its own body. The power from that explosion can propel it up steep mountain paths with amazing speed."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"自分で 身体を 爆発させる。 そのパワーで 急な 山道も すごい スピードで 登っていく。"},{"language":"fr","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"Juste après la mue, son corps est blanc et tendre. Au contact de l’air, sa peau se solidifie et forme une armure."},{"language":"es","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"Nada más mudar la piel, su cuerpo se vuelve blando y blanquecino, pero se endurece al poco tiempo de entrar en contacto con el aire."},{"language":"en","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"Once it sheds its skin, its body turns tender and whitish. Its hide hardens when it’s exposed to air."},{"language":"ja","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"脱皮 したてのときは 全体が 白っぽく 柔らかいが すぐに 空気に ふれて 硬くなる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"Juste après la mue, son corps est blanc et tendre. Au contact de l’air, sa peau se solidifie et forme une armure."},{"language":"es","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"Nada más mudar la piel, su cuerpo se vuelve blando y blanquecino, pero se endurece al poco tiempo de entrar en contacto con el aire."},{"language":"en","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"Once it sheds its skin, its body turns tender and whitish. Its hide hardens when it’s exposed to air."},{"language":"ja","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"脱皮 したてのときは 全体が 白っぽく 柔らかいが すぐに 空気に ふれて 硬くなる。"},{"language":"en","version":"legends-arceus","text":"The rocklike shell is shed each year. The cast-off shell then crumbles, reverting to a mass of soil, which can be spread across fields to promote crop growth."}],"varieties":[{"id":76,"moves":[{"name":"mega-punch","learns":[[1,"machine",0],[2,"machine",0],[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0],[19,"level-up",1],[25,"egg",0],[28,"machine",0],[29,"machine",0]]},{"name":"fire-punch",